[1m[38;5;231mWhich truncation strategy should the truncate option use?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m Exact max length (Recommended)
     [38;5;246mHard cut at the character limit. Deterministic output length; may cut mid-word. Behaves the same for prose and for
[39m     [38;5;246mspace-free input like URLs or IDs.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Last word boundary
     [38;5;246mCut back to the last space before the limit, falling back to a hard cut when there is no space. Reads better on [39m
     [38;5;246mprose; output length varies and can come out much shorter than the limit.[39m
